direction: right
Customer: Customer {shape: person}
Storefront: Web storefront {shape: page}
Gateway: API gateway {shape: hexagon}
Catalog: Catalog service {shape: rectangle}
Cart: Cart service {shape: rectangle}
Orders: Order service {shape: rectangle}
Payments: Payment service {shape: rectangle}
Events: Domain events {shape: queue}
CatalogDB: Product database {shape: cylinder}
OrderDB: Order database {shape: cylinder}
Customer -> Storefront
Storefront -> Gateway
Gateway -> Catalog
Gateway -> Cart
Gateway -> Orders
Orders -> Payments: authorize
Orders -> Events: order placed
Catalog -> CatalogDB
Orders -> OrderDB
Events -> Catalog: update stock
